<h1>Privacy Policy – Chance: Probability &amp; Stats</h1>
<p><strong>Developer:</strong> Divyrs<br>
<strong>App:</strong> Chance: Probability &amp; Stats (Android package <code>com.divyrs.chance</code>)<br>
<strong>Effective date:</strong> 24 November 2026</p>

<p>This Privacy Policy explains how the Chance: Probability &amp; Stats app ("Chance", "the app") handles your information. Chance is developed by Divyrs ("we", "us"). By using the app, you agree to this policy.</p>

<p><strong>In short:</strong> Chance does not collect, sell or share your personal information. Your learning progress stays on your device. The app has no ads, no analytics and no tracking.</p>

<h2>1. Information stored on your device</h2>
<p>To work, the app saves the following <strong>only on your device</strong>:</p>
<ul>
  <li>your learning progress: XP, level, finished lessons, quiz results, daily goal, streak and daily-challenge history;</li>
  <li>your settings: daily reminder on/off and time, sound effects, vibration;</li>
  <li>whether you have unlocked the full course.</li>
</ul>
<p>This information is not sent to us or to anyone else, and we cannot see it. You can delete it at any time with <strong>Settings → Reset progress</strong> in the app, or by uninstalling the app.</p>

<h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
<p>We do not collect any personal information. The app does not ask for your name, email address, phone number, location, contacts, photos or any other personal data, and it does not use advertising IDs.</p>

<h2>3. Purchases</h2>
<p>Chance is free to download. An optional one-time purchase unlocks all lessons. Payments are processed entirely by <strong>Google Play</strong>. We never receive your card or payment details. Google Play only tells the app whether the purchase was successful, so it can unlock the lessons. Your payment is covered by Google's privacy policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>

<h2>4. Notifications</h2>
<p>If you turn on the daily reminder, the app schedules a notification <strong>on your device</strong> at the time you choose. No information is sent to a server. You can turn reminders off in the app's Settings or in your phone's settings.</p>

<h2>5. Sharing</h2>
<p>If you tap <strong>Share</strong>, the app opens your phone's share menu with a short text message. Nothing is sent unless you choose an app to share with, and we do not receive anything.</p>

<h2>6. Third-party services</h2>
<p>The app uses Google Play's billing service for purchases (see section 3). It does not include advertising, analytics or tracking services.</p>

<h2>7. Data security and retention</h2>
<p>Because your progress is stored only on your device, it stays there until you reset it or uninstall the app. We do not keep copies on any server.</p>

<h2>8. Children's privacy</h2>
<p>Chance is an educational app for students and adults. It does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>

<h2>9. Your choices and data deletion</h2>
<p>All data the app stores is on your device and under your control:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Reset progress:</strong> open the app → Settings → Reset progress.</li>
  <li><strong>Delete everything:</strong> uninstall the app.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you have any question about your data, contact us at the address below.</p>

<h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>We may update this policy when the app changes. The new version will be published on this page with a new effective date. Significant changes will also be mentioned in the app's release notes.</p>

<h2>11. Contact</h2>
<p>Divyrs<br>
Email: <strong><a href="mailto:<%= business.email %>"><%= business.email %></a></strong><br>
Website: <a href="https://divyrs.com">https://divyrs.com</a></p>
